{"4879410":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Critical Ward","steam_appid":4879410,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5024620],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/extras\/fa598d99382757526f35476a2e56fa63.avif?t=1793680079\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/extras_big\/fa598d99382757526f35476a2e56fa63.webp?t=1793680079 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span>Critical Ward<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hospital is at its limit. So are you.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Ward<\/strong> is a fast, addictive and <strong>100% arcade survival experience<\/strong>, designed to turn every run from a seemingly manageable shift into a spectacle of absolute chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat patients, build enormous combos, deploy automated medical equipment and create <strong>completely ridiculous builds<\/strong> as the hospital fills with contagious patients, disruptive relatives and events capable of destroying your strategy in seconds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you play, the stronger your build becomes. The stronger it becomes, the harder it is to keep it alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the chaos <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from characters with radically different abilities and playstyles, including specialists in healing, speed, crowd control, technology and strategies that completely transform the rules of each run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn their strengths, complete their challenges and unlock new characters and ways to play through an <strong>old-school progression system with no microtransactions or paid shortcuts<\/strong>.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Huge combos. Absurd builds.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your streak alive, stack powerful bonuses and turn a good run into an overwhelming display of power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets, prototypes, special items, skyrocketing stats and chained effects can transform the screen into glorious chaos. But a single mistake can erase everything you have built.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old-school arcade action<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive pixel art, direct animations and a presentation inspired by classic arcade games. Every character, effect and explosion of chaos is designed to deliver an <strong>authentic old-school arcade experience<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of it is driven by an <strong>incredible soundtrack<\/strong>, created to maintain the intensity and make every run immediately demand another one.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, addictive and <strong>100% arcade survival gameplay<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible soundtrack that drives the chaos from beginning to end.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combo system capable of generating enormous bonuses.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely ridiculous builds and runs that never stop escalating.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with entirely different abilities and playstyles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics with an authentic old-school arcade spirit.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated medical equipment, prototypes and special items.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contagious patients, troublesome relatives and unpredictable events.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, challenges and unlocks inspired by classic progression systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions: everything is earned by playing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense runs with extremely high replayability.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The hospital never stops<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every patient you discharge makes you stronger. Every second brings new problems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect run, push your combo to the limit and discover how much chaos you can control before the entire hospital collapses. <br> <\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/extras\/fa598d99382757526f35476a2e56fa63.avif?t=1793680079\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/extras_big\/fa598d99382757526f35476a2e56fa63.webp?t=1793680079 width=1560 height=504 \/><\/span>Critical Ward<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hospital is at its limit. So are you.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Ward<\/strong> is a fast, addictive and <strong>100% arcade survival experience<\/strong>, designed to turn every run from a seemingly manageable shift into a spectacle of absolute chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat patients, build enormous combos, deploy automated medical equipment and create <strong>completely ridiculous builds<\/strong> as the hospital fills with contagious patients, disruptive relatives and events capable of destroying your strategy in seconds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you play, the stronger your build becomes. The stronger it becomes, the harder it is to keep it alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the chaos <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from characters with radically different abilities and playstyles, including specialists in healing, speed, crowd control, technology and strategies that completely transform the rules of each run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn their strengths, complete their challenges and unlock new characters and ways to play through an <strong>old-school progression system with no microtransactions or paid shortcuts<\/strong>.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Huge combos. Absurd builds.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your streak alive, stack powerful bonuses and turn a good run into an overwhelming display of power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets, prototypes, special items, skyrocketing stats and chained effects can transform the screen into glorious chaos. But a single mistake can erase everything you have built.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old-school arcade action<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive pixel art, direct animations and a presentation inspired by classic arcade games. Every character, effect and explosion of chaos is designed to deliver an <strong>authentic old-school arcade experience<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of it is driven by an <strong>incredible soundtrack<\/strong>, created to maintain the intensity and make every run immediately demand another one.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, addictive and <strong>100% arcade survival gameplay<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible soundtrack that drives the chaos from beginning to end.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combo system capable of generating enormous bonuses.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely ridiculous builds and runs that never stop escalating.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with entirely different abilities and playstyles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics with an authentic old-school arcade spirit.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated medical equipment, prototypes and special items.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contagious patients, troublesome relatives and unpredictable events.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, challenges and unlocks inspired by classic progression systems.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions: everything is earned by playing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense runs with extremely high replayability.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The hospital never stops<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every patient you discharge makes you stronger. Every second brings new problems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect run, push your combo to the limit and discover how much chaos you can control before the entire hospital collapses. <br> <\/p>","short_description":"Treat patients, build massive combos, create absurd builds, deploy automated medical infrastructure, and survive the escalating arcade chaos before hospital saturation reaches 100%.","supported_languages":"English, Italian, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Catalan, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/26f506f4761070b24b8964f31bf1ec17c3c4d441\/header.jpg?t=1793680079","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/f5517618c0ecc4b963779d674ffa0204d8cc6568\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793680079","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4879410\/f5517618c0ecc4b963779d674ffa0204d8cc6568\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793680079","website":"http:\/\/www.criticalwardgame.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Int